      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\nEffect The Sister projects her wrath and rage into the minds of any number of creatures of her choice within 30 feet. Targeted creatures must attempt a DC 32 Will save save.\n\n---\n\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The creature is Off-Guard for 1 round as they become distracted by the unexpected fit of rage.\n\nFailure The creature is Confused for 1 round.\n\nCritical Failure The creature is confused for as long as they remain within 30 feet of the Sister, or until they succeed at the DC 11 Flat check to recover.",
